# Attacking taps a creature only if it lacks vigilance (CR 508.1f, 702.20b), and that happens before the cost to attack is
# paid (CR 508.1h-j): Undermountain Adventurer, with vigilance, is still untapped when Bot2's Ghostly Prison asks {2} for it,
# so its own "{T}: Add {G}{G}" pays it. It attacks, ends tapped by its mana ability, and deals 3; Bot1's Mox Ruby stays
# untapped. (The attacker tapped by attacking cannot do this: an-attacker-tapped-by-attacking-cannot-pay-its-own-cost-to-attack.)

